FeatureName: Eraser Tool

Description:
		This feature allows for the user to eraser drawn shapes on the canvas. The eraser functions
		like a freehand too, similar to squiggle. The user can click and drag the mouse over the canvas
        and remove anything in the path of the cursor.

Reference:
	USER STORY US4.013
