FeatureName: PaintBucket Tool

Description:
		This feature allows the user to click on any shape and change its color to
		the current color selected on the canvas. This tool first detects which shape is
		clicked and immediately changes it's color. This allows the user to draw more
		efficiently without having to restart or redraw any shapes.

Reference:
	USER STORY US4.014
